							"name": "Kinetic Shield",
							"local_notes": "Lore: A tight telekinetic skin around the caster alone.\n\nDesign: Damage Resistance (5/level, B), self only, with Warp Sorcery/ Perils, net -30%. Full modified cost: 5 x 0.7 = ~4 points/level (discounted to a fifth as the cheaper alternative ability); needs Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20) at its full-price rate.",
