					"name": "Crush",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An invisible telekinetic grip that closes on a target's throat or chest, ignoring armour and impossible to dodge.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Crushing, 5/die) with Malediction (+100%, B36) and Armor Divisor (2) (+50%, B103), plus Warp Sorcery/Perils, net +120%. Full modified cost: 5 x 2.2 = 11 points/level; needs Warp Empowerment level 2 (cap 30).",
